{"id":26731,"author":"Destial","body":"Hi.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eI am currently creating a new team called OpenMind. We will mostly play on scrim servers and improve our swords skills. If you want to apply for our new team, meet our requirements first, then proceed to apply using the given format later.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eRequirements:\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003ci\u003e- To be able to use Discord\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/i\u003e-\u0026nbsp;\u003ci\u003eTo be able to be active in-game and in Discord\u003cbr\u003e- To be able to play in Tournaments\u003cbr\u003e- At least able to ninjabridge\u003cbr\u003e- At least has 1000+ kills\u003cbr\u003e- At least 3 days of playtime on Avicus\u003cbr\u003e- Speak in Fluent English (I don't understand Spanish, sorry)\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/i\u003eIf you have met the requirements above, this is the format you are to follow.\u003cbr\u003e\u003ci\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003cb\u003eFormat:\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003ci\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003cbr\u003eAge:\u003cbr\u003eDiscord Tag:\u003cbr\u003eTimezone:\u003cbr\u003ePosition:\u003cbr\u003ePast Teams:\u003cbr\u003eWhich weapons do you prefer using?:\u003cbr\u003eFrom 1 - 10, how active are you?:\u003cbr\u003eFrom 1 - 10, how much is your competitive spirit?:\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThanks for applying.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eMembers:\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003eDestial (Leader)\u003cbr\u003eDa_cake_dood (Leader)","body_tagged":"Hi.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eI am currently creating a new team called OpenMind. We will mostly play on scrim servers and improve our swords skills. If you want to apply for our new team, meet our requirements first, then proceed to apply using the given format later.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eRequirements:\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003ci\u003e- To be able to use Discord\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/i\u003e-\u0026nbsp;\u003ci\u003eTo be able to be active in-game and in Discord\u003cbr\u003e- To be able to play in Tournaments\u003cbr\u003e- At least able to ninjabridge\u003cbr\u003e- At least has 1000+ kills\u003cbr\u003e- At least 3 days of playtime on Avicus\u003cbr\u003e- Speak in Fluent English (I don't understand Spanish, sorry)\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/i\u003eIf you have met the requirements above, this is the format you are to follow.\u003cbr\u003e\u003ci\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003cb\u003eFormat:\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003ci\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003cbr\u003eAge:\u003cbr\u003eDiscord Tag:\u003cbr\u003eTimezone:\u003cbr\u003ePosition:\u003cbr\u003ePast Teams:\u003cbr\u003eWhich weapons do you prefer using?:\u003cbr\u003eFrom 1 - 10, how active are you?:\u003cbr\u003eFrom 1 - 10, how much is your competitive spirit?:\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThanks for applying.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eMembers:\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003eDestial (Leader)\u003cbr\u003eDa_cake_dood (Leader)","created_at":1488805682,"title":"LFM - OpenMind (OPMD)","replies":[{"id":360475,"author":"zicuri","body":"Good luck!","body_tagged":"Good luck!","created_at":1488805736},{"id":360476,"author":"Destial","body":"tanks.","body_tagged":"tanks.","created_at":1488805803,"reply_to":360475},{"id":360478,"author":"KeewiDood","body":"Is there only you and Cake in the team?\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eGood Luck!\u003c/b\u003e","body_tagged":"Is there only you and Cake in the team?\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eGood Luck!\u003c/b\u003e","created_at":1488806793},{"id":360479,"author":"Destial","body":"at the moment, yes\u003cbr\u003eas i said, its a new team i created","body_tagged":"at the moment, yes\u003cbr\u003eas i said, its a new team i created","created_at":1488806918,"reply_to":360478},{"id":360485,"author":"KeewiDood","body":"Okay, nice!","body_tagged":"Okay, nice!","created_at":1488807700,"reply_to":360479},{"id":360486,"author":